@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@adminToken = coller-localement-un-jwt-admin
@cronSecret = coller-localement-le-secret

### Overview admin — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Sans token — 403 ADMIN_FORBIDDEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/overview

### JWT authentifié non admin — 403 ADMIN_FORBIDDEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{nonAdminToken}}

### Heartbeat — 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/heartbeats/purge
X-Cron-Secret: {{cronSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"ok","duration_s":12}

### Métriques — 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/server-metrics
X-Cron-Secret: {{cronSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sampled_at":"{{$datetime iso8601}}","cpu_load_1m":0.35,"cpu_count":2,"mem_total_mb":3819,"mem_available_mb":1474,"swap_total_mb":4095,"swap_used_mb":1929,"disk_total_gb":78,"disk_used_gb":44.5}

### Métriques invalides — 422 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/server-metrics
X-Cron-Secret: {{cronSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
